      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for this change! I had noticed that reading the eeprom stalls workers, but never looked into it.\n\nI have a few questions about stale/missing/broken optics possibly making other optics in a larger instance (say with 100 ports) become stale. PTAL.\n\nSince there are no tests (understandable without ixgbe hardware), could you add a short note on how this was tested, e.g. NIC/PMD, module types (DDM optic, passive DAC, empty cage) and measured read times? Should we test it against other DPDK PMDs?",
      "revId": "c437742035940c69287b86f867521fab99e74427",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
