      "message": "Bad optics will spin the reader (I\u0027ve seen this before on switch/router vendors), perhaps a backoff for failed (or missing) is in order, eg:\n\nf64 max_age \u003d st-\u003evalid ? DPDK_EEPROM_CACHE_MAX_AGE : DPDK_EEPROM_FAIL_MAX_AGE;",
      "revId": "c437742035940c69287b86f867521fab99e74427",
