      "writtenOn": "2026-10-26T11:44:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed, done as you suggested: DPDK_EEPROM_FAIL_MAX_AGE \u003d 30 s for failed reads, 2 s for good ones. A port start/stop (stale flag) still forces a re-read. I kept it fixed rather than exponential: 30 s is short enough that an inserted optic shows up quickly and long enough that a broken one costs at most ~1 s of reader time per 30 s. Happy to change it if you\u0027d prefer exponential.",
      "parentUuid": "83eb310d_2dcacc79",
      "revId": "c437742035940c69287b86f867521fab99e74427",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
    },
