      "message": "errors were not checked here at HEAD, but with the async implementation, other errors (like eeprom read timeout) need to reach the user. Also, there\u0027s a pre-existing memory leak with error not being freed.\n\nI suggest you print and free the error here:\nif (error) {\n  vlib_cli_output (vm, \"%U\", format_clib_error, error);\n  clib_error_free (error);\n}",
      "revId": "c437742035940c69287b86f867521fab99e74427",
